ect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F3J0iwwsq-w\" data-code=\"F3J0iwwsq-w\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/F3J0iwwsq-w/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Dibs on the music.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T09:43:30-07:00","id":905719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PaladinDemo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/895355-dead-pets-and-wraith?p=905663#post905663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[<br /> <br /> I can see having animals as being in the Shadowlands. Not to mention that you can have Hellhounds and Risen cats, either as Risen or Spectres depending on the trauma or if the haunt is controlled by Spectres or Malfeans.<br /> <br /> Dibs on the music.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you have any sources on that? Because everything I remember says a firm &quot;No&quot; to animal wraiths, specters, what have you, except in the Dark Kingdom of Ivory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T15:51:00-07:00","id":906020,"title":"","content":"Ajax, I don't think PaladinDemo is talking about what is in game. He is looking at actual ghost stories in the real world and how they include actual animals.<br /> <br /> The easiest way to include animal ghosts is to just refer to them as being plasmic creatures called Phantasies, but keep their actual nature ambiguous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-06T14:02:25-07:00","id":908595,"title":"","content":"Going that route would make them like cerements.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T12:01:14-07:00","id":910230,"title":"","content":"Mummies could have mummified ghost animal companions, so I think it would be cool if some people's pets are linked to them after death, especially if they say die or are buried at the same time. So Hachi the Dog seems like the type to find his master in the Afterlife, or her was that dog a boy or a girl?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T13:16:11-07:00","id":911842,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure if it counts, but I remember one of the Orpheus books having animal ghosts in it, I can't remember which though... I think it was the first one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/767-lostinsanity","name":"LostInSanity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-23T09:03:59-08:00","id":1161885,"title":"","content":"This is not strictly canon but I would allow someone to have their pet with them in the Underworld and just say that the residual memory of the bond they had with their pet manifests as a phantasy. Depending on what you want to do, you could have the pet simply be there the moment their caul is removed, or you could have another Wraith suggest they go to the Tempest to see what they can find, and their pet walks out of the Tempest as soon as they stare into it. A harrowing could perhaps cause the remembered pet to vanish, which would set up an interesting conflict. Does The Wraith try to find the pet again, or do they let go, which would mean that they are actually letting go of the need to create their pet out of plasm?<br /> <br /> In any case, the pet is not really a ghost. It is a memory given form, and its existence depends on the human wraith giving it that form.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2317-callishka","name":"Callishka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2317_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"264"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-23T12:19:52-08:00","id":1161938,"title":"","content":"The Silver Fang Tribe Book also mentions Ghost Pets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/769-chris-wilson","name":"Chris Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-28T13:13:36-08:00","id":1277243,"title":"","content":"in the Dark Kingdom trilogy both the dark kingdom of Ivory and the New Orleans / Caribbeans have animal spirits, they even talk, i know its a book and not exactly cannon but even in the main books the Ivory kingdom has animal spirits. the Sea of Shadows book gives great details for animal an animal-like creatures.<br /> <br /> that being said i dont see any reason why they cant exist, i truly think they where left out, so the Shadowlands would be empty and only the souls of the dead would be there, making materials rare, and making soul forging all the more important.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24734-deadman","name":"DeadMan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24734_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-29T14:08:24-08:00","id":1277398,"title":"","content":"In the Dark Kingdom of Ivory Talking Animal spirits exist in the Underworld, and the Yin realms spirits besides humans ghosts exists, especially demons.<br /> <br /> Mummies can have mummified ghost animals.<br /> <br /> I feel particularly if someone died with a pet it would be actually nice to have some Wraiths with a spirit tied animal companion.<br /> <br /> Animals aren\u2019t relics though, that would more be effigy animals, which are also a thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-29T14:10:46-08:00","id":1277399,"title":"","content":"One thing I felt Wraith ignored which is rich with potential is the idea of the Underworld side of the Wilderness. Things should be eerie and weird in the places less touched by man, more Primordial. It should be very scary to die there, and not just because of the Maelstrom.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}